{title: Chura Ke Dil Mera}
{artist: Main Khiladi Tu Anari Kumar Sanu}
{key: C#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#m]Chura Ke dil Mera [B]a,        Goriya [C#m]chali
Uda ke nindiya [B]aa,        kahan tu [C#m]chali
[F#]Paagal hua, [C#m]deewana hua,        [F#]Paagal hua, [E]deewana hua
[B]Kaisi ye dil ki [C#m]lagi,        Hoo chura ke dil [B]tera,
chali main [C#m]chali,        Mujhe kya [B]pata,
kahan main [C#m]chali,        [F#]Manzil meri [E]bas tu hi tu
[F#]Manzil meri [E]bas tu hi tu,        [B]Teri gali main [C#m]chali
Oooo chura ke dil [B]mera,        goriya [C#m]chali
Chura ke dil [B]tera,        chali main [C#m]chali
Abhi to [C#m]lage hain,        chahton ke mele,
Abhi dil [B]mera,        dhadkano se [C#m]khele
Kisi mod par main, tumko pukarun,        Bahana [B]koi
bana to na [C#m]loge,        [C#m]Agar main bata dun,
[B]mere dil mei kya hai,        Tum mujhse, [F#]nigahen
chura to na [C#m]loge,        Agar badh gayi hain, [B]betabiyan
Kahin mujhse [F#]daaman,        chuda to na [C#m]loge
Kehta hai [B]dil, dhadkte [C#m]huye,        Tum sanam [B]humare, hum
tumhare [C#m]huye ee,        [F#]Manzil meri [E]bas tu hi tu
[F#]Manzil meri [E]bas tu hi tu,        [B]Teri gali main [C#m]chali
Oooo [C#m]Chura Ke dil Mera,        [B]a, Goriya [C#m]chali
Chura ke dil [B]tera,        chali main [C#m]chali
(Same Pattern Follows for second verse),        Nahi [C#m]bewafaa tum,
ye mujhko khabar hai,        Badlati ruton [B]se magar
mujhko [C#m]dar hai,        Nayi hasrton ki nayi sez par tum
Naya phool [B]koi saja,        to na [C#m]loge
Wafaayen to [B]mujhse,        bahut tumne [C#m]ki hain
Magar is [F#]jahaan mein,        haseen aur [C#m]bhi hain
Kasam meri [B]khaa kar,        itna bata do
Kisi aur [F#]se dil lagaa to na [C#m]loge,        Dheere dheere [B]chori chori
Chupke chupke [C#m]aake mil,        Toot na [B]jaye, pyar [C#m]bhara ye dil
[F#]Manzil meri [E]bas tu hi tu,        [F#]Manzil meri [E]bas tu hi tu
